Z||000000||DecadenceR||06-22-2001||11:57 AM||||What is the longest trip that you have taken straight through, only restroom and fuel up stops, in your Fiero? <P>Mine was a 9 hour drive from my house in NJ to Euclid, Ohio. And then the return trip the next day. I love fiero's, but it was SO nice to get out and stretch...||||reg||1
