Z||000015||chester||06-23-2001||11:44 AM||||We did a 1024 mile trip pulling a 5X8 Uhaul trailer from NH to Southern PA and back in one day.  Had to get em parts!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/trip1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/trip2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000016||tgowens||06-23-2001||12:17 PM||||I've made a trip from Richmond, CA (Oakland area) to Northern KY (Cincinnati area) (or the other way around - east to west) (appx. 2,650 miles) several times in an '87GT (one an automatic and one a 5-speed). Took 2 1/2 days and that was stopping for rest/sleep........great trips though and the cars ride nice!! I usually did around 1,000 miles a day.....<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/index.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>                  <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/3GTS_SIG.gif">                   </A>||||reg||1
